title: "SurveyGraph: Methods-Entity Knowledge Graphs for Academic Survey Generation and Evaluation"
abstract: "An evidence-oriented academic survey generation system built around a multi-layer evolutionary knowledge graph (MEKG), with graph-aware retrieval, survey planning, generation, and evaluation."
